&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Join Our Global Recruitment Team as a Talent Acquisition Associate, EMEA, based out of Manchester. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;279&quot; data-end=&quot;416&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Guidepoint is expanding into &lt;strong data-start=&quot;308&quot; data-end=&quot;322&quot;&gt;Manchester&lt;/strong&gt;, and we&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;348&quot; data-end=&quot;380&quot;&gt;Talent Acquisition Associate&lt;/strong&gt; to help build our newest UK office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;418&quot; data-end=&quot;800&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a unique opportunity to play a key role in our growth, supporting end-to-end recruitment while helping establish Guidepoint&#39;s UK campus recruitment programme from the ground up. Working alongside our global Talent Acquisition team, you&#39;ll partner with hiring managers, build relationships with leading universities and help attract exceptional talent across the EMEA region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;802&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;812&quot; data-end=&quot;847&quot;&gt;hybrid role based in Manchester&lt;/strong&gt;. While our permanent office is being finalised, you&#39;ll initially work from a temporary workspace and remotely.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;960&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All applicants must have the right to work in the UK.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;v5cssg&quot; data-start=&quot;1020&quot; data-end=&quot;1032&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Your Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;1034&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Talent Acquisition Associate, you&#39;ll manage full-cycle recruitment across graduate, corporate and business hiring while supporting the continued growth of Guidepoint&#39;s UK operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;1223&quot; data-end=&quot;1536&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll partner with hiring managers to deliver recruitment strategies, build strong talent pipelines and provide an exceptional candidate experience. Alongside business-as-usual recruitment, you&#39;ll play a key role in developing our UK campus recruitment programme and representing Guidepoint at university events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;11vcmyo&quot; data-start=&quot;1543&quot; data-end=&quot;1560&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1562&quot; data-end=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;avpotq&quot; data-start=&quot;1562&quot; data-end=&quot;1641&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage full-cycle recruitment across graduate, corporate and business hiring.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;83uj6z&quot; data-start=&quot;1642&quot; data-end=&quot;1717&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with hiring managers to deliver effective recruitment strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;se7u3s&quot; data-start=&quot;1718&quot; data-end=&quot;1783&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Source and engage high-quality talent across multiple channels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1p4jssp&quot; data-start=&quot;1784&quot; data-end=&quot;1868&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Build relationships with UK universities, careers teams and student organisations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1sb5ibo&quot; data-start=&quot;1869&quot; data-end=&quot;1961&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Represent Guidepoint at careers fairs, networking events and employer branding activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1bpvpz9&quot; data-start=&quot;1962&quot; data-end=&quot;2040&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage candidate communications, interview coordination and offer processes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;j87l8b&quot; data-start=&quot;2041&quot; data-end=&quot;2152&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the Global Talent Acquisition team to improve recruitment processes and share best practice.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;cubbob&quot; data-start=&quot;2159&quot; data-end=&quot;2179&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2181&quot; data-end=&quot;2721&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1u6300l&quot; data-start=&quot;2181&quot; data-end=&quot;2226&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or equivalent experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;iombk6&quot; data-start=&quot;2227&quot; data-end=&quot;2298&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;1–3 years&#39; experience in full-cycle recruitment (agency or in-house).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;26dnj&quot; data-start=&quot;2299&quot; data-end=&quot;2356&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong stakeholder management and communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;10h0h6g&quot; data-start=&quot;2357&quot; data-end=&quot;2438&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent organisational skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1iul394&quot; data-start=&quot;2439&quot; data-end=&quot;2510&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience sourcing and engaging candidates across multiple channels (LinkedIn Recruiter e.g.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;11xbd0n&quot; data-start=&quot;2511&quot; data-end=&quot;2578&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proficiency with Applicant Tracking Systems and Microsoft Office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;2dtbmh&quot; data-start=&quot;2579&quot; data-end=&quot;2721&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to use AI-enabled tools thoughtfully and responsibly, with attention to accuracy, confidentiality, data quality and human judgement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;12lll1&quot; data-start=&quot;2728&quot; data-end=&quot;2744&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and bonus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
